	(text "Decoupling: one 100n per MCU VDD pin (14), plus 4u7 bulk per rail.\nVCAP1/VCAP2 get 2u2 each - the internal LDO's output, not a supply.\n\n16 MHz HSE divides exactly to 48 MHz for USB. The old board's 24 MHz\ncould not, which left its USB clock at 51.4 MHz.\n\nCAN terminators are HERE, in series with the comms-sheet jumpers."
		(at 19.05 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b7d9c070-b942-4f37-b1f5-3e92a163c831")
	)
